{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "%@（未安装）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (not installed)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@（默认）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ (default)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 个对话等你处理": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld waiting for you"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld 张图片": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld images"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Agent"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenCode 总是可以运行命令，只能在电脑上新建。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenCode always runs commands, so it can only be started on the computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "chrome-use %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "chrome-use %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "chrome-use 已锁定": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "chrome-use is locked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "chrome-use 遥控让你在手机上操作电脑上的 agent 面板；agent 和登录的 Chrome 都留在电脑上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "chrome-use remote drives the agent panel on your computer from your phone; the agent and your signed-in Chrome stay on the computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "chromeuse://pair?…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "chromeuse://pair?…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 下次：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Next: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@”会从电脑上删除，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” will be deleted from the computer. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次付费，永久使用；看对话始终免费": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pay once, keep it forever; reading is always free"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一次性解锁 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unlock for %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅浏览器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Browser only"
          }
        }
      }
    },
