      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Delete this conversation?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原来": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "原来的电脑会从这部手机上删除。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous computer will be removed from this phone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发送回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send answers"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "取消请求": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel request"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有你确定这是同一部手机在新电脑或新地址上的配对时才继续。否则取消，并在电脑上重新运行 mobile pair。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue only if you are sure this phone is being paired with a new computer or address. Otherwise cancel and run mobile pair again on the computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可写文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write files"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可读文件": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read files"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可运行命令": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run commands"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "名称": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图片太大，压缩后仍超过 512 KiB。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The image is still larger than 512 KiB after compression."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在手机上发消息、新建对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Send messages and start conversations from your phone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在电脑上运行 chrome-use mobile pair --url <手机能访问的地址>，扫描终端里的二维码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the computer, run chrome-use mobile pair --url <address your phone can reach> and scan the QR code in the terminal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在电脑上运行 chrome-use mobile serve，再用 chrome-use mobile pair --url <地址> 显示二维码，然后在这里扫码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the computer, run chrome-use mobile serve, then chrome-use mobile pair --url <address> to show a QR code, and scan it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Address"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "失败": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Failed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "失败次数过多，电脑要求稍后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too many failed attempts; the computer asks to try again later."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Done"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时任务": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schedules"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "定时任务在电脑的侧边栏里创建。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schedules are created in the side panel on the computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对方无法证明自己是已配对的电脑，已断开。请检查地址是否正确。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The other side could not prove it is the paired computer, so the connection was closed. Check the address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对话会从电脑上删除，无法恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The conversation will be deleted from the computer. This cannot be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "工作日 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Weekdays at %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "工具结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tool result"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已中断": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Interrupted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allowed"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已发送": {
