    "恢复通知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unmute notifications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复默认": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reset to default"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "或粘贴配对链接": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Or paste a pairing link"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机上新建的对话最多“可写文件”；需要运行命令时 agent 会请你审批。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Conversations started from the phone can at most write files; when the agent needs to run a command it asks you to approve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机会删除它的密钥。要彻底撤销，请在电脑上运行 chrome-use mobile revoke。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The phone deletes its key. To revoke it completely, run chrome-use mobile revoke on the computer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手机端不允许这个操作：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not allowed from the phone: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拒绝": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deny"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "换一个二维码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use another QR code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "排队中的消息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Queued messages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推送令牌被拒绝（%@），正在重新注册。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The push token was refused (%@); registering again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推送内容在电脑上端到端加密，推送服务只转发看不懂的密文。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Notifications are end-to-end encrypted on the computer; the push service only forwards ciphertext it cannot read."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推送服务地址": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push service URL"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推送注册": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push registration"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "握手超时，正在重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Handshake timed out; retrying."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "搜索网页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searched the web"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "操作太频繁，请稍后再试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too many requests; try again shortly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
